-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2c49254a-6510-4e8d-b876-1fc757ab4314\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2c49254a-6510-4e8d-b876-1fc757ab4314\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1014&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1025</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I don't care WHO keeps messing with the printer and adding mistakes to our editions, I'll dock ALL of your pay if it doesn't cease. IMMEDIATELY.\n</p><p><br>\n- Ettvard Needle, Editor in Chief, Baldur's Mouth Gazette\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202308\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28174/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6337/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936678/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.014      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   45.014      1 -total\n 54.71%   24.629      7 Template:Icon_text\n 48.60%   21.875     17 Template:Trim\n 21.26%    9.572      2